Z||000006||Nashco||12-09-2001||11:46 PM||||As much as I dislike the poor use of neons, those neon lights are cool!  A friend of mine has a mind-numbing stereo, and used a few of those through his interior for cool effect.  They're cool because they don't light instantly like most neons, but they slowly light from the inside to the outside  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Nice interior, lookin' good!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<BR>*typo*<p>[This message has been edited by Nashco (edited 12-09-2001).]||||reg||1
